 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 5): the E front (surfaces 4, 5) from w04-68 (2025): a pale concrete grid of five bays by six storeys (cladding panel joints at the bay pitch and storey height), a large mullioned square window in each bay, the first bay blank concrete on floors 1-3 (openBays) and lettered S A / L T on the first floor (signs). The N and S fronts from w03-338s1 (2021) and w02-158s2 (2025) in the same grid; the W front from w01-248s1 (2021): dark boards with ribbon glazing.",
